MUST-FIX

1. "'`src/cli/commands/session.ts:1384` stores nested commit timestamps using `item.date`, but `linked_commit.date` is a synthetic "later of commit/completion" timestamp from `buildActivityTimeline()`. In the common case where commits happen before task completion, multiple linked commits under the same task all inherit the task completion timestamp, so the later intra-group sort (`group.commits.sort(...)`) can no longer reliably order commits chronologically (AC `ac-activity-sort`), and the displayed nested commit ages become incorrect.

